# EXAMPLE topic ACL for the shared cloud broker. Not deployed by this repo; the
# cloud deployment is out of scope.
#
# Each site's bridge logs in with username = its SEN and publishes under
# app/<SEN>/<site_id>/... (see deploy/mosquitto.bridge.template).
# `pattern write app/%u/#` confines a SEN login to its own subtree; verified live
# in plan 17-01 (A8: own subtree accepted, another SEN's subtree denied).
#
# A SEN login has no read grant anywhere, so a compromised site cannot read other
# tenants. fsu-mqtt (the archiver) reads app/#. The cloud history writer
# (ANALYTICS_MODE=cloud-ingest) reads only app/+/+/history/#.

pattern write app/%u/#

user fsu-mqtt
topic read app/#

user analytics-ingest
topic read app/+/+/history/#
